  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>InsaneCraft v1.3.1 是官方 InsaneCraft Modpack 的最後一次更新。我們將不再提供進一步的更新或錯誤修復，並<u>將不再為 InsaneCraft 提供支援</u>。感謝大家追蹤這個整合包並享受系列影片！&lt;3<br><br>實況主：SSundee、Sigils、Henwy、BiffleWiffle 與 JeromeASF。</strong></p>\n<p>+ 250 款瘋狂模組<br>+ 包含失落無限模組&nbsp;<br>+ 官方整合包<br>+ 經典與全新模組<br>+ 免費世界主機功能！（必要模組）</p>\n<p>終極挑戰：收集無限寶石，化身薩諾斯（滅霸）。</p>\n<p>建議記憶體：<br>- 6GB（低）<br>- 8GB（佳）<br>- 16GB（高）</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/527180/description_e4cb3795-16f6-4bad-a2a2-408e3ae8caf4.jpg\"><br></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><em><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/suENVN_n3rw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></em></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8gLD6S73riI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>模組列表（點擊名稱可前往該模組頁面）：</p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/angry-pixel-the-betweenlands-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">邊境之地 (MrCompost)<br></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abyssalcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">深淵工藝 (Shinoow)</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abyssalcraft-integration\" rel=\"nofollow\">深淵工藝整合 (Shinoow)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alchemistry\" rel=\"nofollow\">煉金術 (al132)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambientsounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">環境音效 4 (CreativeMD)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ancient-spellcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">古代咒語工藝 (windanesz)</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/